tools: validate live process publication during lease checks

The runner atomically republishes its current process receipt, so freezing
that file's inode and bytes rejects healthy lease contention checks.
Validate the exact current run through its selected State/ProcessIdentity
SDK and retain append-only child identities while comparing all other
protected state and claims.

Exclude only that publisher's exact 24-hex temporary siblings after private
metadata and no-follow descriptor checks. Expected rename disappearance
does not suppress failures for durable or unrelated paths. The public
lease protocol and runtime authority are unchanged.
